## ObjectType: Manufacturing Operation

Business object in the end-to-end manufacturing sample.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| operation_id | Operation ID | string | Stable business identifier or business attribute. | operation_id |
| production_order_id | Production Order ID | string | Stable business identifier or business attribute. | production_order_id |
| routing_operation_id | Routing Operation ID | string | Stable business identifier or business attribute. | routing_operation_id |
| work_center_id | Work Center ID | string | Stable business identifier or business attribute. | work_center_id |
| operation_name | Operation Name | string | Stable business identifier or business attribute. | operation_name |
| sequence_number | Sequence Number | integer | Stable business identifier or business attribute. | sequence_number |
| status | Status | string | Stable business identifier or business attribute. | status |
| planned_machine_id | Planned Machine | string | Planned machine: the machine (production_machines.machine_id) the schedule puts this operation on; for completed operations the machine of the execution record. | planned_machine_id |
| planned_start_date | Planned Start Date | date | Planned start day YYYY-MM-DD (inclusive); for completed operations the execution start date. | planned_start_date |
| planned_end_date | Planned End Date | date | Planned end day YYYY-MM-DD (inclusive); for completed operations the execution completion date. | planned_end_date |
| standard_duration_days | Standard Duration (Days) | integer | Standard duration in days, 2 from the execution history. | standard_duration_days |
| predecessor_operation_id | Predecessor Operation | string | Predecessor: the operation one sequence step earlier in the same work order; empty for the first operation. | predecessor_operation_id |

### Keys

Primary Keys: operation_id
Display Key: operation_id
